# Rinku Kirana Admin — Environment Variables
# Is file ko copy karke .env naam do aur apni values bharo:
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# .env file kabhi git mein commit mat karo (.gitignore mein already hona chahiye).

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable__your_anon_key_here

# ── AI Image Generation (Bulk ✨ AI Generate) ──────────────────────────────
# Cloudflare Workers AI (flux-1-schnell) se product images generate hoti hain.
# FREE tier: 10,000 neurons/day ≈ ~170 images/day, no credit card.
# Ye values SIRF SERVER-SIDE hain — /api/generate-image (Vercel serverless
# proxy) inhe use karta hai, browser me kabhi nahi jati.
#
# Vercel me deploy karne par ye values Vercel Dashboard → Settings → Environment
# Variables me daalo (project: myshopadmin). Local .env me bhi daal sakte ho
# (npm run dev ke liye).
#
# Kaise milega:
#   1. Cloudflare account banao (FREE): https://dash.cloudflare.com/sign-up
#   2. Account ID: dashboard me right sidebar me dikhta hai
#   3. API Token: My Profile → API Tokens → Create Token → Custom token
#      → Account → Workers AI → Edit
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=your_cloudflare_account_id_here
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=your_cloudflare_api_token_here

# ── Product Image Search (🖼️ Image Manager) ────────────────────────────────
# Search providers — sirf wahi enabled honge jinki key set hai (UI me disabled
# dikhega). Sab SIRF SERVER-SIDE hain — /api/search-images unhe use karta hai.
#
# Vercel me deploy: Vercel Dashboard → myshopadmin → Settings → Environment
# Variables me daalo, phir redeploy. Keys kaise mile:
#   1. Brave Image Search (FREE ~2000/mo, par card chahiye): https://brave.com/search/api/
#   2. SerpAPI Google Images (FREE 100/mo, NO card): https://serpapi.com/
#   3. Bing Image Search v7 (FREE ~1000/mo, card chahiye): Azure portal → Bing Search resource
#   4. Google Custom Search JSON API (FREE 100/day, card chahiye): Google Cloud Console +
#      https://cse.google.com (Search entire web → CX ID)
BRAVE_API_KEY=your_brave_api_key_here
SERPAPI_API_KEY=your_serpapi_api_key_here
BING_SEARCH_API_KEY=your_bing_search_api_key_here
GOOGLE_CSE_API_KEY=your_google_cse_api_key_here
GOOGLE_CSE_CX=your_google_cse_engine_id_here

# ── No-card providers (instant FREE keys, stock photos) ────────────────────
# Pexels: https://www.pexels.com/api/ → account banao → key turant milti hai
#   (200 req/hour FREE, no credit card)
# Pixabay: https://pixabay.com/api/docs/ → account banao → key free
# Openverse: koi key NAHI chahiye — hamesha enabled rehta hai (CC images)
PEXELS_API_KEY=your_pexels_api_key_here
PIXABAY_API_KEY=your_pixabay_api_key_here
